    {
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "content": "Contained Shrapnel",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "content": " You alter your light mortar’s ammunition to prevent fragments of it from flying outward on impact. Your innovation gains the ",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "display": "nonlethal",
            "kind": "crossref",
            "targetId": "trait/nonlethal"
          },
          {
            "content": " trait. You can choose whether to apply the nonlethal trait on each Launch.",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "content": "Enhanced Shrapnel",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "content": " You alter your light mortar’s ammunition to change the way it shatters on impact, spraying nearby creatures with a hail of razor-sharp pieces. Your innovation gains the ",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "display": "versatile P",
            "kind": "crossref",
            "targetId": "trait/versatile"
          },
          {
            "content": " and versatile S traits. You can choose whether to apply one of these traits on each Launch with your innovation.",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "content": "Spring-Loaded",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "content": " You’ve designed your innovation with springs to quickly unfold and extend components, optimizing it for quick deployment. You can deploy your light mortar as a free action.",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          }
        ]
      ],
      "kind": "list",
      "ordered": false
    },
    {
