            "marks": {
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "content": " Each time you Launch, you can choose to alter the ammunition to direct the brunt of the explosion downward, dealing half damage but creating ",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "display": "difficult terrain",
            "kind": "crossref",
            "targetId": "rules/difficult-terrain"
          },
          {
            "content": " in the blast area.",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "content": "Narrow Blast",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": true,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "content": " You alter your ammunition so that the force of the impact is directed in a narrow band. Each time you Launch you can choose to have the explosion form a 20-foot ",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "display": "cone",
            "kind": "crossref",
            "targetId": "rules/cone"
          },
          {
            "content": " instead of a 10-foot ",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          },
          {
            "display": "burst",
            "kind": "crossref",
            "targetId": "rules/burst"
          },
          {
            "content": ". This cone must originate at the point of impact and can be directed either directly away from you or 45 degrees to either side of that.",
            "kind": "text",
            "marks": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "superscript": false
            }
          }
        ]
      ],
